      "content": "That's an interesting distinction. So, when you say District B is vulnerable to \"disinvestment\" and \"instability\" mainly because of its 70% Black demographic and the resident makeup, are you saying that the racial makeup itself is a primary indicator of risk for investors? If we had a district with the exact same socioeconomic stats and building age, but it was majority White, would your forecast for \"instability\" change? I just want to make sure I'm not overlooking if the demographic profile is acting as a proxy for higher crime or lower value in your model.",
